## plan
- set up a fastapi application and define the `/monitor/commands` endpoint.
- implement request parsing to extract `filter_flags` and `command_regex` from the json payload.
- use the `subprocess` module to execute the `ps` command with the specified flags.
- capture the output of the `ps` command and split it into lines.
